Write the opening 2–3 sentences a player would read at the start of the <%= it.display_name %> class chapter.

Rules:
- Use only the facts below. Do not invent setting lore, history, or gods.
- Include primary ability and hit die so a reader can choose the class.
- Never use developer vocabulary (Caster Type, entity_def, seeded, Source: cache, pk=).

Facts:
<% for (const [label, value] of Object.entries(it.core_traits)) { -%>
<%= label %>: <%= value %>
<% } -%>
